格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness Web 的轻拟物与磨砂玻璃主题插件，提供浅色/深色主题、环境光、材质纹理和细腻微交互。Neumorphism + glassmorphism theme plugin for DeepSeek Harness Web with warm light/dark palettes, ambient lighting, grain texture, and subtle micro-interactions.","id":"gh:1335596286","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-neu-theme","slug":"Lhy723/dsh-neu-theme","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Web 的轻拟物与磨砂玻璃主题插件，提供浅色/深色主题、环境光、材质纹理和细腻微交互。Neumorphism + glassmorphism theme plugin"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" for DeepSeek Harness Web with warm light/dark palettes, ambient lighting, grain texture, and subtle"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" micro-interactions."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-neu-theme"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A Neumorphism (soft-UI) theme plugin for **DeepSeek Harness web** — gentle\nraised-and-recessed surfa"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ces in a cream light palette and an ink-dark\npalette, complete with ambient lighting, material gloss"},{"id":"p3s3","text":", grain texture,\nglassmorphism and micro-interactions."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文说明见 README.zh.md。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Two themes** registered into the built-in ThemeRuntime:\n- `neu-light` — cream warm-white canvas,"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" soft slate-blue accent\n- `neu-dark` — ink-blue night canvas, luminous indigo accent\n- **Lighting** "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"— ambient top glow + corner fill painted on the visible\nsurfaces (conversation canvas, sidebar, deta"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ils column), not just body.\n- **Material** — three-layer shadows (contact + cast + top-edge highligh"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"t),\n145° gloss gradients aligned to the light direction, code blocks with a\nbacklit inner wall.\n- **"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"Texture** — fine grayscale grain (inline SVG feTurbulence) over the\ncanvas, sidebar, details column "},{"id":"p6s7","text":"and code blocks.\n- **Glassmorphism** — the composer capsule and its popovers (permission\nmenu, model"},{"id":"p6s8","text":" menu, context panel) share one frosted-glass language: the\ncard's blur lives on a `::before` pseudo"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"-layer so the nested popovers\nkeep their own real `backdrop-filter` blur (the card is not their\nback"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"drop root).\n- **Micro-interactions** — conversation nodes fade in on mount, bubbles\nlift on hover, t"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"he composer recess deepens on hover/focus, tool rows and\nreasoning rows strengthen on hover; all gat"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"ed under\n`@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)`.\n- **Settings row** — Settings → General g"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"ains a Neumorphism picker\n(Default / Neu Light / Neu Dark), persisted through the Host settings\ndocu"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"ment.\n- **Default is pristine** — selecting Default (or having no saved skin)\nleaves the document ex"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"actly as dsh ships it: no injected stylesheet, no\nbody attribute, native colors and shadows."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Neu Light"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Neu Dark"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Install the published package into a dsh profile (works with the `web`\nprofile):"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The package is also available on npm."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then add `\"dsh-neu-theme\"` to `dsh.profile.bundles` in the profile's\n`package.json`, and restart `ds"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"d `\"dsh-neu-theme\"` to `dsh.profile.bundles` in the profile's\n`package.json`, and restart `dsh web`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Once running: **Settings → General → Neumorphism theme** → pick\n**Default / Neu Light / Neu Dark**. "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"The choice is stored in the Host settings\nnamespace `dsh-neu-theme` (normally `~/.dsh/settings.yaml`"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"); choose **Default**\nto return to the built-in appearance."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The Host-backed settings path requires DSH Web Host `0.1.1-rc.2` or newer.\nRemote browsers cannot ac"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"cess the loopback settings API, so their selection\nremains process-local by design."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"While `dsh web` runs with the HMR chain mounted, rebuilding\n`lib/client.js` is picked up by the poll"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ing watcher and hot-reloads only\nthis plugin's fiber."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
